course: dictionary
lesson: 1843
title: Cockatoos: big parrots with a crest
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: A cockatoo is a large parrot. Its most special feature is its crest, a fan of feathers on its head that it can raise and lower. «Cockatoos raise their crest feathers when excited or alarmed.» So when the crest goes up, the bird is probably excited or frightened.
explain: Most cockatoos live wild in Australia and nearby islands. The sentence «in Sydney, cockatoos learned to flip open wheelie bins» gives you a clue: these clever birds live close to people, in Australian cities too.
explain: A word can belong to a bigger group. A cockatoo is a kind of parrot, just as a poodle is a kind of dog. When you meet a new animal word, ask yourself: what bigger group does it belong to?
fact: A cockatoo is a large parrot with a crest of feathers on its head.
fact: Most cockatoos live wild in Australia and nearby islands.
fact: Many cockatoos are white, pink, grey or black.
fact: «Big parrots such as macaws and cockatoos can live over sixty years.»
fact: «A cockatoo called Snowball became famous for moving in time to music.»
exercise: What is a cockatoo? | *A large parrot with a crest of feathers on its head | A kind of tree found in forests | A furry animal that digs burrows | A small fish that lives in rivers
exercise: «Cockatoos raise their crest feathers when excited or alarmed.» When a cockatoo raises its crest, how might it be feeling? | Hungry for a snack | Sleepy and bored | Cold and wet | *Excited or scared
exercise: Where do most cockatoos live wild? | *Australia and nearby islands | In the deserts of Africa | In the snowy mountains of Canada | In the cold seas of the Arctic
test: Why was Snowball's dancing special? | It happened only once in the park | It was a loud screech that scared people | All cockatoos can dance like Snowball | *Animals rarely keep to a beat like that
test: A cockatoo is a kind of what? | Fish | Insect | Dog | *Parrot
exam: Which is true of a cockatoo? | It has no feathers at all | It can live for only one year | *It is a large parrot with a crest it can raise and lower | It lives wild only in Europe
